#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Inspect or export bounded SafeTensors to GGUF with the pinned llama.cpp converter.

Layer recipes support indexed HF or standalone SafeTensors with explicit assets.
Use the source_sha256 from source-digest: a raw standalone file hash or a hash
of all indexed member rows. The standalone assets_sha256 is separate.
Layer overrides target decoder matrix weights. The default applies to all
other ordinary matrices. Vectors and GPT-2 position embeddings retain source
F32; narrower inputs for these tensors are not admitted by the recipe path.
"""
